      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e199cc4871a4256b7c0044e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道后半处于好位置时会增加动力\\n持续提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c3b6eae17774357a1496261573ae89091466470218aed70cd71d1a80f0e6455",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cbd1d8d18dd24937dbc6147",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘时\\n回复持久力,并且稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "73a31b8f5fba9ec3df63f278329257e81d88be91196565f2cf7d6563986411de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02c12e2ae955af60f9f777b7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段的关键时刻\\n大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02ef1367ad379297b65b5a3f95305740333f9fee9200162f51b5c7bd1d1f05d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93d879ceb27b2c35b35e8a09",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时速度提升\\n若为东京赛场2400m的比赛\\n则一段时间内大幅提升\\n＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1313d8357eda1bb11ab3db53de686c8f1cf18fb574d77d4b5b75744cf61f40b7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100101311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ebb7b94ac26ea6ab158f8a2a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若位于中间集团以后\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bf4ff6b4feac123e0dfaeded374e0ddab05ccedb2067a9531723f100c486ae3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100102111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3db40e0e10b65dd086a16657",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘完成超越时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "b32b64aad448c807f20ff87e6c17ac4bf4d788387ddad802c9788afaef2dc263",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100102211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27f38911342fa6db67b4717b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘完成超越时,速度提升、\\n加速度微幅提升\\n并且稍微恢复持久力＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f2ec5863c41d74bb0afc341a2cf4c7fd891e3c7c0e7e8592729ce3f4c4c53a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100103111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:decb4798466e1152ffc06a3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "将自己所承载的强烈信念化为力量\\n在最终弯道上大幅提升速度\\n＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e71e2115ecf22cf6d59ed2998795aa9b8064cd594ab1b963ac90c3b77d681ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100103211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fb7ec4bd07257143e09d28d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上从后方赶超时\\n会使用末脚少量加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "230107a6aeccc06355d46bd2993bdd0c23685f1cb2c199c16370cfb66bbc661d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07bf9c58ef195e22ec22f690",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后从后方绕到外道赶超时\\n在最终直线上加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "951c9653c9fe55db8035fb69a9e08da5d68620c2df928966ca3b40ff3379d20d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47d35a2d34a0ae813d55fb64",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道处于前方时\\n绝对不能被超越的觉悟使得速度提升；\\n若是在长距离比赛中仍体力充沛,变为大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "48920b65cd97eed18ba3ee24ea3660edac7ee220df7f767805ace05c6e3758cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fea480f4fb8f4fa20e37540",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终直线上仍保有余力且处于前列时\\n更容易保持优势",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea70da9300d31994bc9b7c502a619d078ec678062580c5abf87e7c723dad26ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3743c1e7b7828d49b23cd2d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后处于前列\\n和前面或者后面的马娘距离接近时\\n王者般的光辉会使速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "88a0bde0ade27fa814ebd5fee3bdbd905e4d136ba1b6640b3b7d481281258e55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100151"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a3d21b705531cb738cb0af0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道之后在外道完成赶超时\\n以怪物般的力量加快速度\\n如果还在中盘争夺过名次,变为大幅加快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "4acc86fc9c51bc8ac2ba24fb90b6c9bf5616110f42d7203f239dd84dfb5487ea",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100161"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db19ff32a7ba3432196c8f49",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘赶超3次后\\n最终直线上会大幅加速",
      "source_fingerprint": "91f6bc9d268242e18edd3bc04d0959cd268e464bda4da50e7e4d6667c6d0a124",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100171"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1054123b646a64ab78cf8e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道从中后方赶超时\\n犹如女帝般的奔跑会使速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "559411b7c5b648729a99929cb3c78660ad3fab53beade6fd8cfc158fcb9710bb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100181"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e7c217a0b65b74acfebcdc1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘2次赶超的话,就会因近距离膜拜的马娘们过于神圣\\n不假思索地加快速度\\n且路线选择变得更明智",
      "source_fingerprint": "da0b7b4028abff9130a99c95b117b2652301a2204d98371493cce37f56b8ec46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100191"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bf07225cc7fc6db816161f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道上处于第一位时\\n想着这可真是万幸并提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0dd75ff3c4586ecdf23c778b2054948f440e0e1b612597036a901a13babaab8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100201"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b70cd5b45488f3037a1bca48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛开始时起步晚的时间减少\\n并且稍微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "594e0b5a0a31c2d3fb55a6416abb7a1ba87eac9a8ecc8aaf410b388e3e6c9ef6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ef28bb80a9d5aee0f8a4976",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道时若处于领先则提升加速度\\n并且稍微向前方突进＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b092d366285112ba89784870c1ca590481b56149067cb59cdaca2e03b15340d9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd06416b2f051ee15f87d7fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若是逆时针赛道\\n则速度和力量提升\\n若是东京赛马场的1800m比赛\\n则极大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cef5d76d04cb2ff126c7d8554f47c7636f48f454b56f0890d16ef96130444a3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100201311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:593dc873ee626aa4f3725f4f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n速度大幅提升\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa5f0958105b88abff5dea705b7df1febe9fd3c33073e98c26740f7e2ab2a0c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ec81f27047740cd4206325e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在2200m的比赛临近终盘时\\n若自身位于第一名,则一段时间内\\n速度大幅提升＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "12ef664df20524c879e2f6161bb1441a11935286002c277d8537415bba8f6cc2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100202121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:941fdb928859020384a86c8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "出闸时加速度大幅提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "66b7cdc887b5595b1dc338110f8d4691237e25d31f2279fd993d2f1395fe05e5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100202211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19f7d0e0d525c52f0286e058",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半的直线处在好位置\\n或者从集团中部瞄准前方的话\\n就会如闪电一般冲刺",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e2e71ffdbd9c2d90c9ff56ac86146d2e0b415e632e9a9582969cf114e318463",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4447f71f12278c94f6c0293e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在赛程后半若处于好位置并进行名次争夺\\n会因奔跑而身心雀跃\\n速度获得提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "2da73c996d96844682cc05b99430ec4b3f650ab779bfc2a6818dfd38e117153d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5719ab62ba65cdc5b0ecc9a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终弯道前身处前方时\\n速度提升。若是比赛中全程保持冷静\\n胜利的方程式会使速度变为大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4db979e1c2f57be52b96b2ae86199e58e74c4566c479e3d6e096b27ba5a540d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5af78405a0fc7a5943fb94b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n在直线上更容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "be2a4a9fd27efc4eb00f84bdd3a2e212cd95da9dbaa50f3e0ea43d36ea09d8e1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100241"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcf2879e02143f6916ebb187",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程后半,从中间梯队\\n追逐『友人』而逐渐提升速度\\n使前方的马娘畏首畏尾",
      "source_fingerprint": "c75901ffcea28186d0af97cfcd46ced08dbcd96a491312e9bb4c9666b9d77ccf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100251"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f105d77c8027f574f6b4d8d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没有起步晚的情况下\\n在最终直线身处前方时速度提升\\n若是一直保持在靠前位置的话\\n变为速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "c39cec4faec6634de1170e965c107c12067f34436e86e2bb5e8fbc1736086b8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100261"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfd2df887635ec8aa31e68da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道中想要冲向前列时\\n提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "7020a63ff37e8a00ba918e07017c6fd8eea90784ca102e9e3f45761c3d08a717",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100271"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d072721bb3cb7936ebc2145b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛的中段处于好位置准备超越时\\n速度少量提升\\n若是短距离比赛则效果改为\\n小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "e491894e299403a63c9af500ecb1a9d3340a6a6b7589e7f5a9537b54736083c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100281"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6077fc8eaba1b826bd2c292",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后300米处在前方\\n且与最前方的马娘距离很近或是领头时\\n速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4af06b7f998a09bbd0126393d30443b406d00ab68eae7bca882d39a3e3fe146d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100291"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e50db8dafecc20f8bed25063",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘完成超越并身处前方时\\n最终直线上会爆发出强烈的意志\\n使得速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "207dab470a722b28df5e1d672796fda34b1ec2a19eb17cede99b4b89eaef7542",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100301"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:135bb7911e65bbff94d6638a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "左右移动时加速度提升\\n并且小幅提升速度＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "618841073921b707ac5ad9e9f6272f444e69a03f893283481d7df25bef2d580b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd3f886183374860c20023a4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时,一段时间内路线选择\\n变得更明智\\n并且速度与加速度小幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf0ac0a0f818f43ac82a68905e933fd93f4661099e79f06a87b6409095d6ac68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42c129cd67bfdca2b9b74032",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘开始时\\n若位于前方则提升加速度\\n此外，若是东京赛场2400m的比赛\\n则向前突进＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d947a9b1d465443ac375a0fc2fb1062e13cc5fb8184cb9358183a262bbee335a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100301311"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49bdbbfe01e7aa9007f58bc1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘身处前方时\\n回复持久力,并且稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a01ef98e50787be1e9ec371b3ec4723ced444df829236db71d8caca1898a5dc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100302111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8abceb92abd33011bc14983",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "左右移动时回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "59e8b765b529e296b3c7e1e8696209827e2f8d1d47fad1e0987f4d288d714bd5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "100302211"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
